  m_text: 'Movement: W-A-S-D

    Interaction: E

    Use: Q

    Hold Shift + Movement:
    Run

    Space: Jump

    ESC: Pause-Menu


    Objective: Use resource named
    Spawner''s to obtain raw material. Interact with raw material to carry them to
    proper station. Interact with station to process the material.  Processed material
    then can be carreid to the blueprint marker to be constructed. Completing each
    room grants a money and time reward. Try to finish the structure before timer
    ends. Use Market at the gas station to buy items like drinks, oil, and pet food
    if necessary. '
